Package: calculator
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Jaime <info@inled.es>
Depends: libc6, libstdc++6, libsdl3-0, libfreetype6, libgl1, libfontconfig1, libdbus-1-3, hicolor-icon-theme
Recommends: libvulkan1
Provides: gnome-calculator, mayo-calculator
Conflicts: gnome-calculator, mayo-calculator
Replaces: gnome-calculator, mayo-calculator
Description: Calculator for Pulsar OS
 macOS-style calculator with basic and scientific keypads, operator
 precedence, parentheses, memory, 2nd functions, degrees/radians,
 percentages, repeated equals, keyboard/numpad input and locale-grouped
 numbers. Features Liquid Glass styling.
